---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How the Request Experience Works"
  description="Walk through the NorthLine guided service-request demonstration and see how Che Xu Studio designs clearer contractor customer journeys."
  path="/how-it-works"
>
  <section class="section-nl">
    <div class="container-nl">
      <Breadcrumbs
        items={[
          { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
          { name: 'How It Works', path: '/how-it-works' },
        ]}
      />
      <p class="eyebrow">Customer journey</p>
      <h1 class="display page-title">A Clear Path From Question to Next Step</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Homeowners should not need to decode your trade language to ask for help. This journey shows
        how a contractor website can guide decisions without pressure.
      </p>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h2>1. Choose a service</h2>
          <p>Heating and cooling, plumbing, electrical, home maintenance—or “not sure.”</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>2. Describe the request type</h2>
          <p>High-level categories keep the form short and avoid unsafe diagnostic advice.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>3. Share preferred timing</h2>
          <p>Timing preferences communicate planning intent without promising real availability.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>4. Preview contact details</h2>
          <p>In this demo, contact fields are local-only and are not submitted to NorthLine.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>5. Continue with Che Xu Studio</h2>
          <p>After the demo, business owners can request a website plan for their own company.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/request-service">Try the Request Demo</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-accent" data-open-lead
          >Build a Website Like This</button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-open-lead]').forEach((el) => {
    el.addEventListener('click', () => {
      window.dispatchEvent(
        new CustomEvent('northline:open-lead-drawer', { detail: { source: 'how_it_works' } }),
      );
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0.85rem;
  }
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .steps li {
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .steps h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-midnight);
  }
  .steps p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
</style>
